-- ============================================================================
--  wiktionary_labels.sql — one-off data fix, 2026-09-08.
--
--  The Wiktionary import kept each sense's usage labels as a "(label)" prefix,
--  and a few of the source's labels came through mangled ("dated, in,
--  Mainland") or named another Chinese variety the sense also belongs to
--  ("Northern Min", "Hainanese"). This tidies the prefixes on exactly those
--  senses, matched by the word's characters and the sense's current text, so
--  a sense an editor has already rewritten is left alone. Safe to re-run:
--  once a sense is changed it no longer matches. 350 senses.
-- ============================================================================

